		(property "Description" "Generic 8-channel 5V relay module (SRD-05VDC-SL-C style, optocoupler-isolated, usually active-LOW inputs). Header: GND, IN1..IN8, VCC. Relay contacts (COM/NO/NC) are screw terminals, not modeled. Keep the JD-VCC jumper for 3.3V GPIO drive from a shared supply; remove it and feed JD-VCC separately for full isolation. Verify header order against your specific board."
